    "title": "DATASET - Results permeation tests double-skin Pd-based membranes, conventional Pd-based membranes and porous membranes",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.10691625",
    "publication_date": "2024-02-22",
    "description": "<p>Dataset used for:</p>\n<p><span>W. J. R. Ververs, M. Ongis, A. Arratibel, L. Di Felice, and F. Gallucci, &ldquo;On the modeling of external mass transfer phenomena in Pd-based membrane separations,&rdquo; <em>Int. J. Hydrogen Energy</em>, vol. 71, no. April, pp. 1121&ndash;1133, 2024, doi: 10.1016/j.ijhydene.2024.04.337.</span></p>\n<p>Contains permeation data of the following membranes:</p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Porous membranes</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp; S</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Porous Al<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub> support</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp; S-YSZ/Al<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Porous YSZ/Al<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub> on support</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp; S-HT</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Porous hydrotalcite on support</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Conventional Pd-based membranes</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp; S-PdAg</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Supported PdAg membrane</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp; S-Pd</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Supported Pd membrane</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Double-skin Pd-based membranes</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp; S-PdAg-YSZ/Al<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>DS-PdAg membrane with YSZ/Al<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub> protective layer</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp; S-PdAg-HT</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>DS-PdAg membrane with hydrotalcite protective layer</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
